      "parameters": {
        "jsonMode": "expressionData",
        "jsonData": "[Source: Leave Policy]\nEmployees are allowed exactly 10 casual leaves and 15 sick leaves per calendar year. Casual leaves require a 2-day prior notice.\n\n[Source: Working Hours]\nOfficial working hours are from 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM, Monday to Friday. There is a mandatory 1-hour lunch break between 1:00 PM and 2:00 PM.\n\n[Source: Attendance Guidelines]\nDaily attendance must be marked before 9:30 AM via the office portal. Late arrivals more than 3 times a month will result in a half-day pay cut.\n\n[Source: Internship Guidelines]\nInternships run for a duration of 6 weeks. Interns are entitled to 2 casual leaves during their internship tenure.",
