    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "This system works as an AI-powered HR Assistant that answers employee questions accurately by searching a local database instead of guessing [Page 19]. We built it by creating two parallel branches on the same canvas: an ingestion branch and a chatbot branch [Page 18]. The ingestion branch uses a manual trigger and data loader to save custom company policies into a local in-memory vector database using Gemini Embeddings . The chatbot branch connects a chat interface to an AI Agent driven by Llama 3, which accesses those stored policies using a retrieval tool while simple memory tracks the conversation . If a question is outside the loaded documents, the agent is strictly forbidden from inventing policies, safely refusing to answer to prevent hallucinations "
      },
